## @file
#  Network stack PXE gating library: same mechanism as
#  NetworkStackEnabledLib, keyed on gNetworkStackPxeBootEnabledProtocolGuid.
#  Links into UefiPxeBcDxe so PXE boot only starts when enabled from
#  Setup.
